# UI Primitives

Tokens und Varianten: `Letz-Fetz-Game/docs/UI_STYLEGUIDE.md` §2–3

- `Button`: variant = primary | secondary | ghost | danger | success
- Inputs: `bg-gray-800 border-gray-700 focus:border-purple-500`
- Modals: gradient container, `border-purple-500/50`, portal
- Panels: `backdrop-blur-sm border-2 border-purple-500/50`
- Props mit TypeScript; `className` optional für Layout-Overrides
- Keine Business-Logik in Primitives
